From baf7ad1e6eab33a9e760447e8d8c11dd2769c4b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nex <63727521+LuCiLuna@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:39:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 050/114] media: qcom: camss: csiphy-3ph: add SM8350 C-PHY lane
 settings

SM8350 has CSIPHY v1.2.3. Take its 3-phase init from the downstream
camera driver (cam_csiphy_1_2_3_hwreg.h), with the data rate block for
rates up to 2.5 Gsps, and use it when an SM8350 endpoint is C-PHY.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c         | 104 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 104 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
